#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step1.html:11
msgid ""
"In order to establish communication with your LEAF, TCU (Telematic Control "
"Unit) unit's SIM card needs to be replaced and its settings programmed. Have "
"you done that?"
msgstr ""
"LEAF-iga suhtlemise loomiseks tuleb TCU (Telematika juhtseadme) SIM-kaart "
"vahetada ja selle seaded programmeerida. Kas oled seda teinud?"

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step1.html:17 ui/templates/ui/setup/step1.html:26
