msgid "Yes, continue"
msgstr "Jah, jätka"

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step2.html:29
msgid "Let's gather information about your TCU Unit"
msgstr "Kogume teavet sinu TCU-üksuse kohta"

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step2.html:30
msgid ""
"It's time to hop in your LEAF and find identifiers that are unique to your "
"car. Start your car and follow steps to get identifiers from navigation "
"system:"
msgstr ""
"On aeg hüpata oma LEAFi ja leida sinu autole ainulaadsed identifikaatorid. "
"Käivita auto ja järgi samme, et saada identifikaatorid navisüsteemist:"

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step2.html:33
msgid "1. Press the hard button labeled Menu"
msgstr "1. Vajuta kõva nuppu, millel on märge 'Menu'"

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step2.html:34
msgid "2. Press the “CARWINGS” soft button on the center display screen."
msgstr "2. Vajuta keskekraanil asuvat 'CARWINGS' pehmet nuppu."

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step2.html:35
msgid ""
"3. Press the “CARWINGS Settings” soft button on the center display screen."
msgstr "3. Vajuta keskekraanil asuvat 'CARWINGS Settings' pehmet nuppu."

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step2.html:36
msgid ""
"4. Scroll down if necessary and press “Unit ID information” soft button on "
"the center display screen."
msgstr ""
"4. Kerige alla, kui vaja, ja vajuta keskekraanil asuvat 'Unit ID "
"information' pehmet nuppu."

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step2.html:37
msgid ""
"5. Write down identifiers Unit ID, TCU ID, SIM ID and VIN. Then enter them "
"to the form below"
msgstr ""
"5. Kirjuta üles identifikaatorid Unit ID, TCU ID, SIM ID ja VIN. Seejärel "
"sisesta need allolevasse vormi"

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step3.html:29
msgid "Back to basics"
msgstr "Tagasi põhitõdede juurde"

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step3.html:32
msgid "Nickname for your vehicle"
msgstr "Hüüdnimi sinu sõidukile"

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step4.html:30
msgid ""
"LEAF TCU expects to receive an SMS command to establish connection to the "
"server. To deliver the SMS, you have several options regarding which service "
"will be used for this task."
msgstr ""
"LEAF TCU ootab SMS-käsu saamist, et luua ühendus serveriga. SMS-i "
"edastamiseks on sul mitu võimalust, millist teenust selleks kasutada."

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step4.html:30
msgid "We recommend using"
msgstr "Soovitame kasutada"

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step4.html:30
msgid "Hologram IoT SIM Card"
msgstr "Hologram IoT SIM-kaart"

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step4.html:30
msgid ""
"in your TCU, because it offers free SMS messages to the device. Other "
"services may require cost per SMS."
msgstr ""
"oma TCU-s, kuna see pakub seadmele tasuta SMS-sõnumeid. Teised teenused "
"võivad nõuda SMS-i eest tasu."

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step5.html:8
msgid "All done!"
msgstr "Kõik valmis!"

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step5.html:9
msgid ""
"You're done with providing necessary information to establish connection "
"with your LEAF."
msgstr "Oled lõpetanud vajaliku teabe esitamise, et luua ühendus oma LEAF-iga."

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step5.html:9
msgid "You can now use TCU services."
msgstr "Nüüd saate kasutada kaugteenuseid."

#: ui/templates/ui/setup/step5.html:10
msgid ""
"Did you know? If you also change connection settings on your navigation "
"unit, you will get detailed vehicle statistic informations."
msgstr ""
"Kas teadsite? Kui muudate ka oma navigatsiooniseadme ühenduse seadeid, saate "
"üksikasjalikku teavet sõiduki statistika kohta."

